     1066         ) no-error .
     1067       for each thbjattr_thbj-attr
     1068       on error undo, return error return-value
     1069       :
     1070         case thbjattr_thbj-attr.prop-code :
     1071           when 'denstclc':U then do:
     1072             if thbjattr_thbj-attr.prop-value-type = 'character':U then do:
     1073               assign
